## Installation & Usage

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/hasan-jwaied/image-editor.git
   cd image-editor
   ```
2. Install the required I/O helper library:
  pip install Pillow

3. Run the CLI tool:
  python3 image_editor.py my_img.png